hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"846","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Aqeel ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, Urwa bin Zubair se, ke Usama bin Zaid ne unhen khabar di, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek aisi majlis tak pahunche jis mein Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul tha, aur ye us waqt tha jab Abdullah bin Ubayy ne abhi Islam qabool nahin kiya tha, to us ne kaha: hamein hamari majlis mein takleef na do, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Saad bin Ubada ke paas dakhil hue to farmaya: Ae Saad, kya tum nahin sunte jo Abu Hubab keh raha hai, un ki murad Abdullah bin Ubayy ibn Salul tha."
"847","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam hamare paas tashreef late thay, aur mera ek chhota bhai tha jis ki kunniyat Abu Umair thi, aur us ke paas ek nughar tha jis se wo khelta tha phir wo mar gaya, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye to use ghamgeen dekha to farmaya: ise kya hua hai, un se kaha gaya: us ka nughar mar gaya hai, to farmaya: Ae Abu Umair, nughair ka kya hua."
"848","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mugheera se, Ibrahim se, ke Abdullah ne Alqama ki kunniyat Abu Shibl rakhi, halanke un ke han koi bachcha paida nahin hua tha."
"849","Aarim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman Aamash ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim se, Alqama se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne mujhe kunniyat di is se pehle ke mere han koi bachcha paida hota."
"850","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham bin Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Abbad bin Hamza se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aayi to maine kaha: Ae Rasoolullah, aap ne apni biwiyon ko kunniyat di hai to mujhe bhi kunniyat dijiye, to aap ne farmaya: apne bhanje Abdullah ke naam par kunniyat ikhtiyar karo."
"851","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Abbad bin Hamza bin Abdullah bin Zubair se, ke Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ne kaha: Ae Nabiyullah, kya aap mujhe kunniyat nahin denge, to aap ne farmaya: apne bete ke naam par kunniyat rakho, yani Abdullah bin Zubair murad thay, phir un ki kunniyat Umm Abdullah hui."
"852","Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hazim ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sahal bin Saad se, ke Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu ke nazdeek un ke naamon mein se sab se mehboob naam Abu Turab tha, aur wo khush hote thay ke unhen is naam se pukara jaye, aur unhen Abu Turab naam Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke siwa kisi ne nahin diya tha, ek din wo Fatima se naraz hue to bahar nikal aaye aur masjid mein deewar ke sath let gaye, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke peeche tashreef laye, to kaha gaya: wo deewar ke paas lete hue hain, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye jabke un ki peeth mitti se bhar gayi thi, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ki peeth se mitti saaf karne lage aur farmate thay: Ae Abu Turab baith jao."
"853","Abu Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: isi dauran ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam hamare khajooron ke ek bagh mein thay jo Abu Talha ke khajooron ka bagh tha, aap qazaye hajat ke liye bahar tashreef le gaye, aur Bilal aap ke peeche chal rahe thay, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki tazeem ki wajah se ke aap ke barabar na chalen, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek qabr ke paas se guzre to khade ho gaye, yahan tak ke Bilal aap tak pahunch gaye, to farmaya: Ae Bilal tera bura ho, kya tum sunte ho jo main sunta hun, unhon ne kaha: main kuch nahin sunta, to farmaya: is qabr wala azab diya ja raha hai, phir maloom hua ke wo Yahudi tha."
"854","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail se, Qais se, unhon ne kaha: maine Muawiya ko apne ek chhote bhai se kehte hue suna: ladke ko apne peeche sawar kar lo, to us ne inkar kar diya, to Muawiya ne us se kaha: tumhari badi buri tarbiyat hui hai, Qais ne kaha: phir maine Abu Sufyan ko kehte hue suna: apne bhai ko chhor do."
"855","Saeed bin Ufair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Ayyub ne mujh se bayan kiya, Musa bin Ali se, un ke walid se, Amr bin Al-Aas se, unhon ne kaha: jab dost zyada hote hain to qarz khwah zyada ho jate hain, maine Musa se kaha: ghurama kya hain, unhon ne kaha: huqooq."
"856","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Amir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub bin Sabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid jo Ibn Kaisan hain se, unhon ne kaha: main Ibn Umar ke paas tha, to Iyas bin Khaisama un ke paas aa kar khade hue aur kaha: Ae Ibn Farooq, kya main aap ko apna shair na sunaoon, unhon ne kaha: kyun nahin, lekin mujhe achche ke siwa na sunana, phir us ne unhen sunaya yahan tak ke jab wo kisi aisi cheez tak pahuncha jo Ibn Umar ne napasand ki, to unhon ne us se kaha: bas karo."
"857","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hamein khabar di, Qatada se, unhon ne Mutarrif ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: main Imran bin Husain ke sath Kufa se Basra tak raha, to kam hi koi manzil aisi thi jis mein wo utarte magar wo mujhe shair sunate thay, aur unhon ne kaha: beshak kinaya wali baaton mein jhoot se bachne ki badi gunjaish hai."
"858","Abu al-Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Shuayb ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ne khabar di, ke Marwan bin al-Hakam ne unhein khabar di, ke Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad bin Abd Yaghoos ne unhein khabar di, ke Ubayy bin Kab ne unhein khabar di, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: beshak sher mein hikmat hai."
"859","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abu Hammam Muhammad bin al-Zibriqan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Yunus bin Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Hasan se, Aswad bin Sari se: maine kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, beshak maine apne Rabb azza wa jalla ki hamdon ke sath madh ki hai, unhon ne farmaya: suno, beshak tumhara Rabb hamd ko pasand karta hai, aur unhon ne us se is par zyada kuch na kaha."
